Patch sent as attachment are hard to review as we have no way to comment 
on the changes.

Moreover the patch lacks a proper git commit message/title.
Along the commit message you also need to add a proper Signed-off-by line.

You can read more about our process and patch submission procedure here:

https://community.openvpn.net/Development/DeveloperDocumentation#community-patches-and-the-acceptance-process-of-these-patches

